    "One existing legacy-empty function ran both in the retained IEEE selector and an explicit selector; unique regression counts deduplicate it. No duplicate test body was added.",
    "Four correctly typed present-value stale controls were added to the existing witness function after the first matching run. Only that changed function plus scoped lint/format were repeated. Production, source and expectations were unchanged.",
